    "audience": "An online survey of adults in South Korea about a new digital currency issued by the central bank (CBDC). Around 51% women, 18% in Seoul, 62% married, 47% with a college degree. Age breakdown: 16% ages 19–29, 26% ages 30–45, 29% ages 46–59, 29% age 60+. Before CBDC is offered, for a private purchase in person about 39% choose cash, 34% card, 8% mobile, and the rest have no preference.",
